 "notes": [
  "SOUND CONFIG (original scene 35: init 0x3b6b8, list 0x3b52d, draw 0x3b426, exit 0x3b213; sprites 0x1fde30, selected 0x1fde10 at 0x1fdf48, digits at 0x1fdf68, help strings 0x1fdf98).",
  "Up and down move the cursor (wrapping on a new press); left and right change the item's value, wrapping on a new press as the original's helper does (flags 0x17). The volumes are heard as they change and kept on EXIT, the only way out. Cancel moves the cursor to EXIT.",
  "volume items show their level (0-255) as zero-padded digits ending at number, and a bar per_step units wide a level (the original scales an 8-texel strip by level/8).",
  "The SE test counts through test_sounds in order (the original's four banks, 0x253800); confirm plays the effect and makes no other sound.",
  "value_repeat is how fast a held left or right changes a value; the original's pad repeat timing is not known, so this is the port's.",
  "The selected item pulses throughout. now_playing is the credit for the music (the original starts AWAKETO1 here)."
